<div id="p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:144%;">Appendix</span></p>
</div>
<section id="Pt0.A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.A </span>Additional Steering Results</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present the steering of the backdoor results across all attacks and poisoning rates for the three considered datasets. Figures <a href="#Pt0.A1.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix 0.A Additional Steering Results ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A1.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix 0.A Additional Steering Results ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> and <a href="#Pt0.A1.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix 0.A Additional Steering Results ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> present these results for CIFAR-100, Tiny-ImageNet and CIFAR-10 datasets, respectively. The number of attacks varies across datasets, as some models were not available for download on BackdoorBench or had low ASR.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A1.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.10806v1/images/steering_2/cifar100_vit_b_16_all_attacks_all_ratios_subplots.png" id="Pt0.A1.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:381/447;" width="381" height="447" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Steering results on CIFAR-100 over seven attacks and three poisoning rates.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Pt0.A1.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.10806v1/images/steering_2/tiny_vit_b_16_all_attacks_all_ratios_subplots.png" id="Pt0.A1.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/190;" width="381" height="190" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>Steering results on Tiny-ImageNet over three attacks and three poisoning rates.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Pt0.A1.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.10806v1/images/steering_2/cifar10_vit_b_16_all_attacks_all_ratios_subplots.png" id="Pt0.A1.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:381/383;" width="381" height="383" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Steering results on CIFAR-10 over six attacks and three poisoning rates.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.B </span>Additional Weight Orthogonalization Results</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#Pt0.A2.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix 0.B Additional Weight Orthogonalization Results ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> shows weight orthogonalization results for the Tiny-ImageNet dataset, while Table <a href="#Pt0.A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix 0.B Additional Weight Orthogonalization Results ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows these results for CIFAR-10.
In only a few cases, the ASR after weight orthogonalization does not drop below 1%, while CA always remains close to the baseline results.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A2.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Weight orthogonalization results on Tiny-ImageNet across poisoning rates (PRs).</figcaption>
<div id="Pt0.A2.T3.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:59.7pt;vertical-align:-28.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-110.7pt,19.2pt) scale(0.6,0.6) ;">
<p id="Pt0.A2.T3.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A2.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="Pt0.A2.T3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:566.5pt;height:98pt;vertical-align:-46.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
<span id="Pt0.A2.T3.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A2.T3.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">

<span id="Pt0.A2.T3.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_thead">
<span id="Pt0.A2.T3.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
