<div id="Pt0.A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Cosine similarity for all models is shown in this section. References for specific dataset/poisoning rate settings are in Table <a href="#Pt0.A4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix 0.D Additional Cosine Similarity Tables for Starting From Clean Images ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>. The dataset/poisoning rate for each table is also indicated in the respective caption.</p>
</div>
