<section id="Pt0.A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.E </span>Additional Cosine Similarity Tables for Starting From Backdoored Images</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Cosine similarity for all models is shown in this section. References for specific dataset/poisoning rate settings are in Table <a href="#Pt0.A5.T16" title="Table 16 ‣ Appendix 0.E Additional Cosine Similarity Tables for Starting From Backdoored Images ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>. The dataset/poisoning rate for each table is also indicated in the respective caption.</p>
</div>
