<section id="Pt0.A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.F </span>Backdoor Detection in Weights</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Figures <a href="#Pt0.A6.F14" title="Figure 14 ‣ Appendix 0.F Backdoor Detection in Weights ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>, Figure <a href="#Pt0.A6.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Appendix 0.F Backdoor Detection in Weights ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>, and Figure <a href="#Pt0.A6.F16" title="Figure 16 ‣ Appendix 0.F Backdoor Detection in Weights ‣ Backdoor Directions in Vision Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>, we show threshold-layer combination results (Z-scores) for CIFAR-10, CIFAR-100 and Tiny-ImageNet datasets, respectively. The figures show results across different attacks and poisoning rates. Here we see that the detection method works for some attacks, specifically the stealthier ones, but is not successful across all attacks and all scenarios.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A6.F14" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.10806v1/images/model_detect/cifar10_vit_b_16_grid_search_all_ratios_subplots.png" id="Pt0.A6.F14.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:429/541;" width="429" height="541" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span><math id="Pt0.A6.F14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z</annotation></semantics></math>-scores for CIFAR-10 dataset across different attacks and poisoning rates.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Pt0.A6.F15" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.10806v1/images/model_detect/cifar100_vit_b_16_grid_search_all_ratios_subplots.png" id="Pt0.A6.F15.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:381/561;" width="381" height="561" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span><math id="Pt0.A6.F15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z</annotation></semantics></math>-scores for CIFAR-100 dataset across different attacks and poisoning rates.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Pt0.A6.F16" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.10806v1/images/model_detect/tiny_vit_b_16_grid_search_all_ratios_subplots.png" id="Pt0.A6.F16.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/268;" width="429" height="268" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 16: </span><math id="Pt0.A6.F16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z</annotation></semantics></math>-scores for Tiny-ImageNet dataset across different attacks and poisoning rates.</figcaption>
</figure>
